ned Photo and Text Posts", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L53", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_story_missions", "label": "Story Missions (go/find/hold steps)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L58", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_gps_minigames", "label": "GPS Mini-games (Treasure Hunt, Street Sprint, Checkpoint Rally)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L60", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Targets generated server-side around the trusted position; hidden spots never sent to the client."}, {"id": "readme_goals", "label": "Goals (world operation, faction goal, milestones)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L62", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every questEvent feeds per-user, per-faction and world counters per week."}, {"id": "readme_store_sponsor_spots", "label": "Store and Sponsor Spots", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sponsor spots timed server-side with daily cap; purchases credited once per session by webhook or on return."}, {"id": "readme_stripe_checkout", "label": "Stripe Checkout (REST, no SDK)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L135", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_live_game_settings", "label": "Live Game Settings (GameConfig overrides)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L66", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every tunable has a default in lib/settings.ts; admin overrides stored in GameConfig, cached 15 s per instance, sent to clients via /api/me; applyConfig() updates constants in place on both sides so changes go live without redeploy."}, {"id": "readme_spawns", "label": "Deterministic Spawns (Pokemon-GO style)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L127", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deterministic per ~450 m cell and 20-min window so everyone sees the same world with zero storage; server rebuilds a spawn from its id to verify claims."}, {"id": "readme_time_of_day", "label": "Solar Time of Day and Daily Streaks", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L128", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_anti_cheat", "label": "GPS Anti-cheat (server trusted position, 250 km/h jump limit)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L129", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_live_layer", "label": "Live Layer (polling /api/loc, /api/sync, chat)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L130", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Serverless-friendly polling (sync every 4 s, chat every 3 s, online = pinged in last 90 s); swap in a hosted realtime service behind notify() for scale."}, {"id": "readme_deliveries", "label": "Real Package Deliveries (escrow + handover code)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L131", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_admin_panel", "label": "Admin Panel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L136", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Admin granted by opening /admin?key=<ADMIN_KEY> once in a browser that has played."}, {"id": "readme_seo", "label": "SEO (SSR landing, JSON-LD, sitemap, robots, PWA manifest)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L137", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_marketing_referrals", "label": "Marketing: Referrals and UTM Attribution", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L138", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_guest_accounts", "label": "Guest Commander Accounts (no login, 1-year cookie)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L87", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_test_mode", "label": "Test Mode (no GPS, teleport)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L91", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lets players without walking test the game; TEST_MODE=off restricts it to admins in production."}, {"id": "readme_game_speed", "label": "GAME_SPEED Timer Multiplier", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L95", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_local_dev_setup", "label": "Local Development Setup", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_e2e_tests_playwright", "label": "Playwright End-to-End Tests (api + ui suites)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L98", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Run against a separate streetquest_e2e database; include double-tap race checks so identical concurrent request